{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一百洛叉，數與前等，即千萬也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即那庾多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錫蘭說止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即頻跋羅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱舍論者止此，過此以上之數，難計算之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一大千界可稱量之原子數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一大千界不可稱量之力點數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一大千界之名相分別心數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上十信菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上三賢菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上加行菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上初地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上二地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上三地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上四地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上五地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上六地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上七地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上八地菩薩數學"}
