{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上十地菩薩數學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無數也，乃超過菩薩之數學也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "算學之真量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "質素之真量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上真比量之極量"}
